#ASSERT `Under section 42(1), is this day treated as a day of incapacity for work for my claim under section 40 or 41 after I stopped qualifying remunerative work` TRUE (Date 10 4 2025) (Date 30 6 2025) (Date 31 3 2025) TRUE TRUE (Date 2 4 2023) TRUE (Date 9 4 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
