#ASSERT `Under section 124(1), am I entitled to income support` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 100 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Income of 100.01 exceeds the applicable amount of 100.
#ASSERT `Under section 124(1), am I entitled to income support` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE 100.01 100 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Income 30 against an applicable amount of 100: the excess of the applicable amount over income is 70.
