#ASSERT `Under section 126(1), does section 126 apply to me` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Under 16: section 126 cannot apply.
#ASSERT `Under section 126(1), does section 126 apply to me` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Weekly rate of 80 apart from paragraph (b), relevant sum 53: the excess, 27.
