#ASSERT `Under section 137(1), are the other person and I a couple` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The same, but in circumstances regulations prescribe to take us out of being a couple.
#ASSERT `Under section 137(1), are the other person and I a couple` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
