-- A funeral expenses payment of a prescribed amount in prescribed circumstances.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), may the payment I am asking about be made out of the social fund` `s 138(1)(a) a payment to meet funeral expenses` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Some other payment: the subsection does not say "only".
#ASSERT `Under section 138(1), may the payment I am asking about be made out of the social fund` `s 138(1) some other kind of payment` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A prescribed amount to a prescribed description of persons, for heating in cold weather.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(2), may a heating payment for cold weather be made to me` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not heating expenses in cold weather: the Act does not say.
#ASSERT `Under section 138(2), may a heating payment for cold weather be made to me` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A crisis loan whose terms were notified before payment.
