-- A grant is not a loan: the subsection speaks of loans.
#ASSERT `Under section 139(4), is my crisis loan or budgeting loan repayable on the terms notified to me` `s 138(1)(b) a community care grant` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The appropriate officer has not determined otherwise: payment is to be made to me.
#ASSERT `Under section 139(5), is payment of my award to be made to me` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The officer has determined otherwise: payment is not to be made to me as of right.
#ASSERT `Under section 139(5), is payment of my award to be made to me` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- For a community care grant, the officer must have regard to the nature, extent and urgency of the need.
#ASSERT `Under section 140(1), must the officer have regard to a matter in deciding my award` `s 138(1)(b) a community care grant` `s 140(1)(a) the nature, extent and urgency of the need` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- ... and, where the payment is repayable, to the likelihood of repayment.
