-- ... but not where it is not repayable.
#ASSERT `Under section 140(1), must the officer have regard to a matter in deciding my award` `s 138(1)(b) a community care grant` `s 140(1)(d) where the payment is repayable, the likelihood of repayment and the time within which repayment is likely` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- For a budgeting loan, to my personal circumstances of a description specified in directions.
#ASSERT `Under section 140(1), must the officer have regard to a matter in deciding my award` `s 138(1)(b) a budgeting loan` `s 140(1A)(a) such of the applicant's personal circumstances as are of a description specified in directions` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- For a budgeting loan, subsection (1A) names only (b), (d) and (e) of subsection (1).
#ASSERT `Under section 140(1), must the officer have regard to a matter in deciding my award` `s 138(1)(b) a budgeting loan` `s 140(1)(a) the nature, extent and urgency of the need` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A direction or guidance under subsection (2) displaces the duty.
#ASSERT `Under section 140(1), must the officer have regard to a matter in deciding my award` `s 138(1)(b) a community care grant` `s 140(1)(a) the nature, extent and urgency of the need` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A woman who reached the 25th week on 1 December 2010, was advised, and is in Great Britain.
