#ASSERT `Under section 143(3), is a day when my child was away from me disregarded` `s 143(3)(b) undergoing medical or other treatment as an in-patient in a hospital or similar institution` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Residential accommodation under a listed arrangement, in prescribed circumstances.
#ASSERT `Under section 143(3), is a day when my child was away from me disregarded` `s 143(3)(c) in residential accommodation pursuant to arrangements made under one of the Acts listed, in prescribed circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
