-- Married but separated under a court order: not a married couple, and no other limb.
#ASSERT `Under section 145A(2), am I entitled to the child benefit a dead partner would have received` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The first person did not die before the end of the period.
