-- Somewhere the paragraph does not name.
#ASSERT `Under section 148(1), am I entitled to a Christmas bonus` `s 148(1)(a) somewhere else` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not entitled, and not treated as entitled, to a qualifying benefit.
