-- Cases for the seat layer of lines 3718-4330 (Parts 12ZC, 12ZD, 12ZE and XIIA).  Every expected value is written beside its
-- assertion from the text of the Act, before the run, and is never copied from the code's output.  Each case is the facts a
-- real person in the seat would state.  Calendar facts: 1 January 2026 is a Thursday; 10 January 2026 is a Saturday;
-- 16 July 2026 is 196 days after 1 January 2026 (the 197th day of an unbroken series that began on 1 January).
-- The lower earnings limit of 100 pounds a week is an ARBITRARY TEST INPUT, not law.

