#ASSERT `Under schedule 1 paragraph 3A(2), how much of my employer's secondary Class 1 contribution may be recovered from me under our agreement` 500 300 0 (Date 18 5 2000) (Date 1 6 2005) (Date 28 7 2000) EQUALS 0

-- 3B(3): election made 10 January 2005, ended by notice on 1 February: in force on 31 January.
