-- 3B(8): refused, but I did not apply (it was given to me): not covered.
#ASSERT `Under schedule 1 paragraph 3B(8), may I appeal against the Inland Revenue's refusal or withdrawal of its approval` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

