#ASSERT `Under schedule 3 paragraph 5, are the contribution conditions satisfied for this benefit` `widow's pension` (Date 1 6 2011) FALSE 1 FALSE FALSE FALSE 20 15 5 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

